  "notes": [
    "Anthropic cache rates follow section 2's mechanics (read 0.1x input, write 1.25x at 5 min, 2x at 1 h) rather than being copied out of section 1's table. pricing/table.test.ts asserts the rule for every anthropic row, so a typo cannot hide.",
    "Rows whose provider is not in PROVIDER_KINDS are forward data for sub-phase 7.4. They are listed in NOT_YET_ROUTABLE in pricing/table.test.ts, which is what keeps them deliberate rather than orphaned.",
    "Prices change week to week (docs/spec/01-decisions.md section 9). Bump `revision` on every edit: it is stamped into ai_calls.meta.pricingRevision, so an old charge stays explicable."
  ],
